      <p class="text-gray-300">Cloudblast is a new entrant that surfaced on LowEndBox in August 2026 with a sharp opening offer: €3.6/mo for 1 vCPU / 3 GB RAM / 20 GB NVMe, a 10 Gbps network port, and DDoS protection bundled on every plan. Three active data centers (Amsterdam, Salt Lake City, Hong Kong) cover most low-latency needs; a fourth UK location is announced as "coming soon".</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at €3.6/mo (VMA11, hourly billing available)</p>
