    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ €3.6/mo entry undercuts most EU/US budget VPS at the same tier while including 10 Gbps + DDoS standard</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 10 Gbps network port on every instance — unusual at this price point (most budget VPS tiers ship 1 Gbps)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ DDoS protection bundled on every plan, not a paid add-on</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ True hourly billing — resize, rebuild, or delete from the panel without commitment</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ KVM/Proxmox virtualization on AMD EPYC 7551P / 7C13 / 7663 host nodes</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Accepts Monero (XMR), AliPay, and credit cards via Stripe</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ One-click apps for Coolify, Dokploy, n8n, Nextcloud, Pterodactyl, Supabase, WordPress + 9 more</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Only 3 active data centers (Amsterdam, Salt Lake City, Hong Kong) vs Vultr's 32+ or HostHatch's 14</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Hong Kong bandwidth capped at 1 TB/month while US/NL are unlimited — buyers picking HK specifically need to size accordingly</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ New vendor (Aug 2026 LEB coverage) — limited public track record, no uptime history beyond the August launch window</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Storage tops out at 200 GB NVMe even on the 64 GB tier — heavy-disk workloads need block storage add-on (€0.15/GB/mo)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No GPU instances, no managed-service tier — bare self-managed KVM only</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ No published SLA / uptime guarantee on the pricing page (only LowEndBox-mentioned "DDoS protection standard")</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
